,{"key":"source_ref","html":"§14.4, Example 14.3, p. 391; scan 399; local deterministic subclass"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§14.4, Example 14.3, p. 391; scan 399; local deterministic subclass"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)\">\\(G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G)\">\\(\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e81a88fc44254236\" href=\"?note=e81a88fc44254236\" title=\"73-df-zero-l-system\">73-df-zero-l-system</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(f:\\Sigma\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，同态扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat f\">\\(\\widehat f\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"85832410fcdc9965\" href=\"?note=85832410fcdc9965\" title=\"73-df-word-homomorphism\">73-df-word-homomorphism</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N,w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N,w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DOL}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\exists!u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(a,u)\\in P\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DOL}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\exists!u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(a,u)\\in P\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DOL}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\exists!f:\\Sigma\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;(a,f(a))\\in P\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DOL}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\exists!f:\\Sigma\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;(a,f(a))\\in P\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n(\\widehat f)^0(w)\\coloneqq w,\\qquad(\\widehat f)^{n+1}(w)\\coloneqq\\widehat f((\\widehat f)^n(w))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n(\\widehat f)^0(w)\\coloneqq w,\\qquad(\\widehat f)^{n+1}(w)\\coloneqq\\widehat f((\\widehat f)^n(w))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DOL}(G)\\land P=\\{(a,f(a)):a\\in\\Sigma\\}\\Longrightarrow L(G)=\\{(\\widehat f)^n(\\omega):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DOL}(G)\\land P=\\{(a,f(a)):a\\in\\Sigma\\}\\Longrightarrow L(G)=\\{(\\widehat f)^n(\\omega):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>每个字符恰有一个右部时，所有位置的并行改写就是同态扩张的一次作用。D0L 的 D 在此特指处处唯一规则，因而比仅要求“至多一个规则”更强。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-zero-l-system","status":"resolved","id":"e81a88fc44254236","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-zero-l-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-word-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"85832410fcdc9965","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-word-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-zero-l-system","status":"resolved","id":"e81a88fc44254236","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)$ 满足 $\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G)$，见 [[73-df-zero-l-system]]。$f:\\Sigma\\to\\Sigma^*$，同态扩张 $\\widehat f$ 见 [[73-df-word-homomorphism]]；$n\\in\\mathbb N,w\\in\\Sigma^*$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-word-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"85832410fcdc9965","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)$ 满足 $\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G)$，见 [[73-df-zero-l-system]]。$f:\\Sigma\\to\\Sigma^*$，同态扩张 $\\widehat f$ 见 [[73-df-word-homomorphism]]；$n\\in\\mathbb N,w\\in\\Sigma^*$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\Sigma\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat f","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N,w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DOL}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\exists!u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(a,u)\\in P","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DOL}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\exists!f:\\Sigma\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;(a,f(a))\\in P","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n(\\widehat f)^0(w)\\coloneqq w,\\qquad(\\widehat f)^{n+1}(w)\\coloneqq\\widehat f((\\widehat f)^n(w))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DOL}(G)\\land P=\\{(a,f(a)):a\\in\\Sigma\\}\\Longrightarrow L(G)=\\{(\\widehat f)^n(\\omega):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":true}],"bytes":2304,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-345","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-zero-l-system|D0L 系统与同态迭代]]"}],"outgoing":["e81a88fc44254236","85832410fcdc9965"]}